msgid "Create: Factory Controller Manual"
msgstr "Руководство Create: Factory Controller"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/index.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Create: Factory Controller provides a block called the \"`factory "
"controller`\", which allows you to place factory gauges and other components "
"on a virtual board stored inside the block. Factory gauges placed in factory "
"controllers also receive many functional enhancements."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/index.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This manual provides a reference to the features of the mod, some of which "
"are difficult to explain fully in the UI. You do not need to read the manual "
"in full to use the mod."
msgstr ""

